{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id150733942"}, "name":{"label":"Jillori0129!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-18T10:56:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14682529043"}, "title":{"label":"We love Cozi!"}, "content":{"label":"We use Cozi for everything! Grocery lists, vacation planning, content ideas, home projects, movie and TV show lists, anything we can create a list for. My spouse and I share our lists so nothing ever gets missed! Loyal fans!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id230784657"}, "name":{"label":"NikatKimber"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-16T20:58:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14675983535"}, "title":{"label":"Very helpful"}, "content":{"label":"We just started using this recently, and it's been very nice to have a synced list. \n\nHowever, one simple addition to the shopping list would make it a lot more handy: a short comments section for each item. For example, we are shopping for an item, and want to check prices at Walmart, target, an amazon. This would allow us to put item codes or links and the prices in the list.\n\nUpdate: been using for years now. They added the comments section! It’s simple, syncs between users, and works!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
