{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id28510307"}, "name":{"label":"maddie14"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-05T07:56:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14630902101"}, "title":{"label":"Interface and Ads Ruin Experience"}, "content":{"label":"I love the idea of what this app can do, but I’m a big believer that form is just as important as function in terms of making something truly valuable. I’m a UI/UX designer, so maybe I weigh this part too heavily, but I found the interface clunky and not well designed. It felt dated. For an app you interact with daily and design your whole life around, it needs to be a beautiful experience for the user. Especially if you’re asking the user to pay $80/year.  The free version has display ads, which is incredibly distracting.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id268540696"}, "name":{"label":"Sha-mama"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-04T02:23:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14626044323"}, "title":{"label":"New glitch?"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used Cozi for probably 10 yrs and obviously love it’s concept or I would have moved away from it. Used it while raising my kids and now as an empty nester. Have paid for Cozi gold on multiple occasions and other times used its basic features. However, it lost its 5th star in this rating because of a new glitch I’ve been expert for several months now. Why am I receiving a popup every time I open the app that congratulates me on using Cozi gold and another popup telling me that I don’t have it ?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id216569220"}, "name":{"label":"dosmith13"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-03T14:35:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.08.28"}, "id":{"label":"14624342038"}, "title":{"label":"Love it!"}, "content":{"label":"This has been a game changer. I’m not forgetting appointments, I’m not searching emails to find the links, I can backtrack to get information.   I also love the ease of use. My only suggestion would be  to have  the interface matched the logo. The logo is pretty  but the calendar looks like it’s from the “dos” age and the font is not. I like the interface/font of the brilliant app or Shopify.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=407108860&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
